                  Constant(value='Framed question + CoT spine + ToT branches + Reflexion layer + Partner poll + Chosen path (with depth and slide caps labels).'),
                  Constant(value='\n===============================================================================\nSECTION 4.K.x — REASONING (HARDENED ASCII, v17)\n===============================================================================\n\nDEPTH 0: 🧑\u200d💼 GENERAL ANALYST (Greedy Decoding, deterministic)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- CoT line cap = 6 slides\n- Greedy decoding → always pick top-1 token (argmax)\n- Analogy: Generalist drafts 6-slide baseline deck (never discarded mid-process)\n\nDEPTH 1: 👩\u200d💻 SPECIALISTS (ToT Branches, Sampling ON)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- TOT_MAX_DEPTH=2, TOT_BRANCH_FACTOR=3\n- Sampling ON → Temperature > 0, Top-K/Top-P active\n- Specialists A, B, C = Branch 1, 2, 3 (biased focus via attention heads)\n- Analogy: Specialists each draft 2-slide biased decks, revise per feedback\n\nDEPTH 2: 👔 SENIOR MANAGER REVIEW (Reflexion)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- REFLEXION_ROUNDS=2\n- Round 1: critique → issues redlines\n- Round 2: confirm fixes after Specialists revise\n- Feedback loop: Specialists don’t invent new tangents, they revise per redlines\n\nDEPTH 2: 🧑\u200d⚖️ PARTNER POLL (Self-Consistency Vote)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- SC_K=5, majority_required=true\n- 5 partners each review a variant 3–6 slide distilled deck (not identical)\n- Reviews are independent and parallel (no handoff)\n- Analogy: 5 partners sit around the table, each with a slightly different 4-slide deck;\n  they each read, interpret, and vote independently\n- Consensus emerges not from “everyone checking the same slides” but from\n  independent perspectives converging (or diverging)\n- Voting → consensus ≥3/5 PASS; dissent logged as risk note\n\nDEPTH 3: 🏆 CHOSEN PATH (Final Client Deck)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Archetype confirmed\n- Fixes applied\n- Risks logged\n- PASS\n===============================================================================\n'),
                  Name(id='true', ctx=Load()),
